he view and playback; **bird's eye** and **front view** are presets.\\n    ┊ 476 │ +At either end, arrows continue to the adjacent presentation page. **Session**\\n    ┊ 477 │ +or the title-bar minimize button restores park control. Returning to the page\\n    ┊ 478 │ +preserves state; leaving the station or logging out clears it. Each visited\\n    ┊ 479 │ +Scalar step counts toward Power progress.\\n    ┊ 480 │ +\\n    ┊ 481 │ +An optional `title` prop changes the window title. The demo is an in-memory\\n    ┊ 482 │ +presentation: displayed `git meta` commands follow `../git-meta`'s CLI, but do\\n    ┊ 483 │ +not execute against a repository. A–D, C1–C3 and T1–T3 are readable aliases;\\n    ┊ 484 │ +nested Git path trees and metadata bookkeeping are omitted. All four keys use\\n    ┊ 485 │ +`path:demo`. Explicit `set --timestamp` values date k1/k2 to August 31, 2026 and\\n    ┊ 486 │ +k3/k4 to September 11, so `prune --since 2026-09-01` retains exactly C/D.\\n    ┊ 487 │ +Setup assumes `.git-meta` names the shared remote without a depth limit.\\n    ┊ 488 │ +\\n    ┊ 489 │ +Run `node scripts/check-scalar.mjs` for the native interaction test, or add\\n    ┊ 490 │ +`--packaged` after packaging. It captures add, prune, setup, and read screenshots\\n    ┊ 491 │ +in `unreal/Saved/Screenshots/`.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────╮\\n tpp:27b scripts/check-scalar.mjs │\\n──────────────────────────────────╯\\n\\n@@ -1,0 +1,28 @@\\n────────────────\\n  ┊  1 │ +import {mkdtemp,mkdir,writeFile,copyFile,rm} from 'node:fs/promises';\\n  ┊  2 │ +import {tmpdir,homedir} from 'node:os';\\n  ┊  3 │ +import {join,resolve} from 'node:path';\\n  ┊  4 │ +import {spawnSync} from 'node:child_process';\\n  ┊  5 │ +import {compileStations} from '../src/compiler.mjs';\\n  ┊  6 │ +const dir=await mkdtemp(join(tmpdir(),'park-scalar-test-'));\\n  ┊  7 │ +try {\\n  ┊  8 │ + for(let i=1;i<=8;i++) {\\n\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.131121583}","type":"input_text"}],"session_id":"01a08fab-6619-7